 "text": "Deceiving the enemy mattered just as much. UN forces bombed and shelled Kunsan and the east coast, faking landings elsewhere. Two days before the landing, destroyers sailed right up to Wolmi-do to draw the enemy's fire. The moment those guns fired back, their carefully hidden positions were revealed, and the warships destroyed them.",
